  "name": "hotosm_gbr_points_of_interest",
  "notes": "\nOpenStreetMap exports for use in GIS applications.\n\nThis theme includes all OpenStreetMap features in this area matching ( Learn what tags means [here](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Tags) ) :\n\ntags['amenity'] IS NOT NULL OR tags['man_made'] IS NOT NULL OR tags['shop'] IS NOT NULL OR tags['tourism'] IS NOT NULL\n\nFeatures may have these attributes:\n\n- [name](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:name)\n- [name:en](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:name:en)\n- [amenity](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:amenity)\n- [man_made](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:man_made)\n- [shop](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:shop)\n- [tourism](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:tourism)\n- [opening_hours](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:opening_hours)\n- [beds](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:beds)\n- [rooms](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:rooms)\n- [addr:full](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:addr:full)\n- [addr:housenumber](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:addr:housenumber)\n- [addr:street](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:addr:street)\n- [addr:city](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:addr:city)\n- [source](http://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:source)\n\nThis dataset is one of many [OpenStreetMap exports on\nHDX](https://data.humdata.org/organization/hot).\nSee the [Humanitarian OpenStreetMap Team](http://hotosm.org/) website for more\ninformation.\n",
